title: Bryce's Music

-- synopsis
A good chunk of the music I've made and recorded throughout my life.
-- synopsis

-- more
Most of this music I never 'released' in any official capacity, I've just made
and posted on Mastodon or shared with friends and family. But I'm finally going to 
post / share most of this, even if it's pretty amateur.

The various "artists" are all still me:

* Bryce Willey is obviously me
* bryce.avx is what I'm putting my forays into live coding and dungeon synth under.
* DDT is my middle school band where I originally started writing and recording songs for.
